    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Dana Smith",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101762045847742429785/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXjSjHHj-Bh_FTNIlAFxg6TyGSF3gfGbLjfZghEysawvFX7Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "absolutely incredible. Unbeknownst to me, I had a blocked drain from my house to my septic tank. Benoit and Simone took on the job like it was their house. all fixed and we are very happy\n\ni would also like to add, that none of this would’ve happened, if my first contact, Lori-anne hadn’t made sure that i was able to get a truck to my house within the day\n\nBig thanks to all.",
        "time": 1759868803,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "enyellamit",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102842026230883668764/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIaTvQcg8lVq7MHN3SL4i6YhjVMKy2t0NLZD0pnLHkdeUxkZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Great! It was to drop then pickup a dumpster from my residence for some home improvements. The driver was polite and efficient. He even moved my vehicle from in front of the unit for me. Thanks Sanivac.",
        "time": 1754575488,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "kristine Lewis-Charles",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117349592526964324576/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLl3nMK9pozdwSQzenLJbt7NnQdvq0_DLXpBNmnfl5QkcfLXw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "SUPER amazing customer service from Mickael and Sonia! friendly and took the time to understand my needs. the Disabled potty drop off and tote fill up was right on time. Even the fella that dropped off the potty and filled up our tote was great! he took the appropriate time needed to fulfill his tasks. With really excellent folks looking after the best interest of there organization. I can see how Sanivac is ranked at almost a 5 star.\ndefinitely recommend them!!!!",
        "time": 1751658842,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dennis Brazolot",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105193040991681068669/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKt9Lf9b-ExiawQE32oMuGT8ztA6oYDgfNfWE1p7A9iedNqyg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We had a major backup in our sewer system that was causing overflows in the shower, toilet, and kitchen sink. An emergency plumber initially tried to help but didn't have the necessary equipment to fully resolve the issue.\n\nThen Shawn and Mourad from Sanivac came to our rescue. While the service wasn't cheap, these two gentlemen were professional, efficient, and dedicated. They tackled the problem head-on and had everything fixed and cleaned up within three hours. Their work ethic was truly commendable.\n\nWhen there seemed to be no other solution, Shawn and Mourad made it happen. They didn't stop until the job was done. Thank you, Shawn and Mourad!",
        "time": 1719330811,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alex Kirill",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103501811423740285503/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUooIbyYplhGv078Z4sAN2lU5Nltq1NBRqYikz3JLzMC7wz0qYN=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Thank you to Anthony Allitt for his expertise and his kindness in helping with choosing the right product for my needs!\n\nHosting an event has never been easier!",
        "time": 1753657979,
